{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_05_beg","storyGroup":"act45side","storySort":10,"storyDependence":"act45side_level_act45side_04_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"SS-5","storyName":"通往舞会的邀请函","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"在睦的梦境中，保留着原本记忆的睦并没有选择离开梦境，而是决定在雷姆必拓做一个普通的小女孩。原本想要劝睦离开的祥子发现睦在这里生活得比以往任何时候都要幸福，内心纠结的她选择在睦表演时离席。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act45side/level_act45side_05_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act45side_05","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":8,"next":10,"characters":["若叶睦","丰川祥子","？？？","睦的母亲","温米","众人"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_bg_65_g10_dreamcastlestage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":8},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>我们一同欢笑，我们一同哭泣。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":10},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>在华丽的舞台上，上演一出热闹非凡的独角戏。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":11},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>我，毋畏死亡。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":12},{"type":"subtitle","id":13},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":15},{"type":"dialog","id":16},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":17},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":18},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":19},{"type":"charslot","id":20},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_bg_65_g9_warmrabbitnest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":21},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":22},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":23,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":24},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#1$3","duration":"0.7","id":26},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"祥，来，喝下去。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fd/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":30},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":31},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":32},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkswllw","volume":"0.6","id":33},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"喉咙没有那么痛了……","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3","focus":"m","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"那就好。这个给你，雷姆必拓到处都是沙尘，水袋和护目镜是必需的。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-13$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":39},{"type":"charslot","id":40},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_pcket","volume":"0.7","id":41},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":42},{"type":"text","text":"祥子接过睦递来的物资，她的双手紧紧地攥着它们，鼓胀的水袋好像随时都要被挤破。","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#16$3","focus":"m","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"祥，你有点奇怪。是不是不舒服？","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-16$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"不，没什么……","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"睦，你……还记得我？","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3","focus":"m","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"当然。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-14$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你还记得我们经历过的那些事？","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3","focus":"m","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"嗯，我全都记得。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-14$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":55},{"type":"charslot","id":56},{"type":"text","text":"祥子感觉自己终于变得冷静了些，她开始环顾四周——","id":57},{"type":"text","text":"方才她们顺着狭长的矿道一直深入，最终来到了这里。","id":58},{"type":"text","text":"这里阴暗潮湿，只有油灯和炉火提供着微弱的光亮。","id":59},{"type":"text","text":"床与餐桌之间仅有一人宽的空隙，而从桌上水杯的数目来看，这里住着的绝不止睦一人。","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"睦，你在这里……已经生活多长时间了？","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3","focus":"m","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"一年，也许更久。在这里需要考虑的事很简单，时间的流逝也没有那么明显。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-13$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"不……你对时间没有任何感觉，是因为你身处在梦里。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"睦，你为什么会做这样一个梦……","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#16$3","focus":"m","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"梦……？","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-16$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"睦，我有重要的事和你说。这里不是现实，我们现在应该——","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":72},{"type":"charslot","id":73},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":74},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"啊呀——小睦，你怎么现在就回来啦？","id":76},{"type":"dialog","id":77},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","id":78},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_kneelsnow_s","volume":"1","delay":"1","id":79},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":80},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"12","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":82},{"type":"text","text":"一个身影从身后跑了进来，径直将睦扑倒在柔软的小床上。","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"妈、妈妈，身上有灰，不要蹭……","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"哎，都快一天没见了，让我抱抱怎么了嘛！","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"有、有人……","id":86},{"type":"dialog","id":87},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cloakmovement","volume":"1","id":88},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#1$3","duration":"1","id":90},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":91},{"type":"dialog","id":92},{"type":"charslot","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"啊，小祥在这呀！","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"你好久没来我们家了吧？","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"南小姐……","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"哎，怎么这么见外啦，叫“南”就行啦。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3","focus":"m","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"嗯，我有时也会这么叫妈妈。","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-13$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"……","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"睦，你和南小姐的关系什么时候这么好了……？","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":106},{"type":"charslot","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"我们一直关系很好啊，毕竟是母女嘛~","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"小睦，今天的收获如何？","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3","focus":"m","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"（翻找口袋）今天天气有点热，买黄瓜汁的人比平时多一点。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-13$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":113},{"type":"charslot","id":114},{"type":"text","text":"睦小心翼翼地将手中的布袋打开，里面是一些零星的硬币。","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"嗯——小睦，你好棒！","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"（翻翻口袋）喏，这是我的。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#15$3","focus":"m","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"哇……妈妈，好厉害。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-15$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"哼哼，不知道为什么，今天找我修补衣服的人格外多哦！","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"你爸爸今天也很努力哦，在工地里忙活了一整天。我给他送午饭时，看他那副灰头土脸的样子实在不忍心，就特批他下工后去喝一小杯。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"他现在啊——估计已经一大瓶啤酒下肚了吧！","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"刚好今天小祥来了，机会难得，不如我们请大家一起来吃饭吧！","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3","focus":"m","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"大家能聚在一起吃饭，好开心。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-13$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"是呀！而且今天收入不错，不多吃点怎么行！","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"……","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"小祥千万别客气！","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#16$3","focus":"m","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"祥，怎么了？","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-16$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"不……没有……","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":139},{"type":"charslot","id":140},{"type":"text","text":"眼前这个明显就不富裕的家，光秃秃的泥巴墙、微弱的油灯……","id":141},{"type":"text","text":"为什么睦的梦里，会出现这些？","id":142},{"type":"dialog","id":143},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","volume":"1","id":144},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":145},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":146},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4081_warmy_1#11$2","duration":"0.7","id":148},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4081_warmy_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温米","text":"小睦，还有南……这位是？","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4081_warmy_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3","focus":"m","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"她是我从小认识的朋友，祥。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-13$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4081_warmy_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温米","text":"你好~","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_4081_warmy_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4081_warmy_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温米","text":"我来是想问问你们，要不要共进晚餐？","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4081_warmy_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温米","text":"我做了很多份，你们要是乐意的话，就一起来吧。","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4081_warmy_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"……这怎么好意思呢？","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4081_warmy_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温米","text":"我听你们的邻居说，你们家的烟囱好像几天都没动静了……","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_4081_warmy_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#10$3","focus":"m","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"（摸摸肚子）唔……","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4081_warmy_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温米","text":"而且，离上次聚会已经快一个月了吧？","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4081_warmy_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温米","text":"大家都很想再听到小睦的演奏呢。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4081_warmy_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"这样的话……小睦，你是怎么想的呢？","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#5$3","focus":"m","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"我、我……我吗？","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"小祥肯定也很想听小睦的演奏吧？就算听了这么多次，还是百听不厌呢！","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"如果不介意的话，就在我们家办聚会吧！其实我们刚刚还在商量要请大家一起来吃饭呢。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3","focus":"m","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"祥，你觉得呢？","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-14$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我……","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我觉得……睦，由你自己来决定吧。","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3","focus":"m","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"……嗯，那我愿意。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-13$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":183},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":184},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":185},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":186},{"type":"charslot","id":187},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_bg_65_g9_warmrabbitnest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":188},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":189},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","volume":"0.4","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":190},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":191,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":192},{"type":"playsound","key":"$clink","id":193},{"type":"playsound","key":"$clink","loop":"false","channel":"1","delay":"0.04","id":194},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":195},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"1.5","id":196},{"type":"text","text":"喧闹声，欢笑声，干杯声。","id":197},{"type":"text","text":"不大的屋子里挤满了人，但大家好像并不在意空间的拮据。","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"来来来，再来一杯！","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"这一杯，让我们欢迎小睦的朋友——祥子！","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":202},{"type":"charslot","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"众人","text":"哦——祥子，你好！","id":204},{"type":"text","text":"大家一齐看向坐在角落的祥子。","id":205},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"（举起酒杯）小祥……？","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"干、干杯。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":210},{"type":"charslot","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"众人","text":"干杯——！","id":212},{"type":"dialog","id":213},{"type":"playsound","key":"$clink","id":214},{"type":"playsound","key":"$clink","loop":"false","channel":"1","delay":"0.04","id":215},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":216},{"type":"text","text":"欢迎仪式过后，大家的注意力又重新回到了聚会本身。祥子独自靠在角落的墙上，眼神复杂地看着眼前的这一切。","id":217},{"type":"dialog","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"r","id":219},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","id":221},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":222},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3","focus":"l","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"祥。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-14$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"r","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"睦……？","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#10$3","focus":"l","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"其实……我全部都知道。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"r","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"欸……？","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#10$3","focus":"l","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"这一切都是假的，南会对我这么温柔，都是假的。","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"r","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"这，这都是——","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3","focus":"l","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"所以见到你的时候，我就知道，自己该回去了。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-14$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3","focus":"l","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"但是，给我一个机会吧。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-13$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"一个告别的机会，然后再结束。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-13$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"至少在这里，我也想像你们一样，能自由地歌唱一次。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-13$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"r","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"睦……","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":243},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walk_stage","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"nw","id":244},{"type":"stopsound","fadetime":"2","channel":"nw","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":246},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":247},{"type":"dialog","id":248},{"type":"charslot","id":249},{"type":"text","text":"没等祥子回应，睦抱着吉他，缓缓朝人群走去。","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"小睦，你准备好了吗？","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":253},{"type":"charslot","id":254},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":255},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3","duration":"1","id":256},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#16$3","focus":"m","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"……大家好。","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-16$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":260},{"type":"charslot","id":261},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cheer_street","volume":"1","id":262},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#16$3","focus":"m","id":264},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":265},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#9$3","focus":"m","id":266},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#10$3","focus":"m","id":268},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"怎么啦，小睦？有什么问题吗？","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#16$3","focus":"m","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"……椅子。我的椅子。","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-16$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"给你准备好咯。喏，这个椅子，是你常用的那把吧？","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":276},{"type":"charslot","id":277},{"type":"text","text":"睦小心地打量着那把高脚椅，椅面上布满了深深的裂纹。","id":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3","focus":"m","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"嗯，就是它。","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-13$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":281},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":282},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothtrailground","volume":"1","id":283},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":284},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":285},{"type":"text","text":"睦缓缓坐下，所有人都跟着放轻了呼吸。","id":286},{"type":"dialog","id":287},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":288},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":289},{"type":"charslot","id":290},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":291},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":292},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":293},{"type":"multiline","name":"若叶睦","text":"接下来，请聆听……","id":294},{"type":"multiline","name":"若叶睦","text":"《春日影》。","id":295},{"type":"dialog","id":296},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":297},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":298},{"type":"charslot","id":299},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_65_i07_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":300},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":301},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":302,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":303},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"——！","id":305},{"type":"text","text":"一生都无法忘记的旋律，在睦的梦境中再次被奏响。","id":306},{"type":"text","text":"跟记忆里一样，此刻睦手中吉他的声音无比清澈悠扬，温暖着每一个人。","id":307},{"type":"text","text":"眼前的若叶睦，却让祥子感到无比陌生。","id":308},{"type":"text","text":"她已经不是那个不善于表达自己感情的睦了。","id":309},{"type":"text","text":"虽然她还在努力尝试学会表达，但她在这里，似乎很幸福。","id":310},{"type":"dialog","id":311},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":312},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":313},{"type":"sticker","id":314,"multi":"true","text":"“内心满是憔悴，眼神颤抖不止”","x":"300","y":"270","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":315,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n“我在这世界孤独一人”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":316,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n“这不断凋零的春季”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":317,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n“每年都只予我冰冷”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":318},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":319},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"睦，这也是你的愿望吗……","id":321},{"type":"text","text":"今天她有无数次机会拉睦离开这里，而且她相信睦一定会跟她走。","id":322},{"type":"text","text":"可她始终不忍这么做。","id":323},{"type":"text","text":"因为现在的睦，看上去像是发自内心地感到幸福。","id":324},{"type":"text","text":"人们随着音乐轻晃着身体，微弱的烛光将他们的影子映在了墙上，就像春日暖阳下摇曳的树影一般。","id":325},{"type":"text","text":"而睦坐在椅子上，被所有人包围着。她闭着双眼，手在琴弦间来回拨动，轻声歌唱。","id":326},{"type":"text","text":"此刻的她，又在想些什么呢？","id":327},{"type":"dialog","id":328},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":329},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":330},{"type":"sticker","id":331,"multi":"true","text":"“令人揪心又惹人怜爱”","x":"300","y":"230","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":332,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n“感觉此刻就能够明白”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":333,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n“使人幸福又催人痴迷”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":334,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n“照耀着无法哭泣的我”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":335,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n“光芒温柔地携我同行——”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":336},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":337},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":338},{"type":"text","text":"莫名的情绪笼罩在祥子的心头——","id":339},{"type":"text","text":"是欣慰……还是不甘？抑或两者都有。","id":340},{"type":"text","text":"现在的若叶睦，比和自己在一起时，要开心得多。","id":341},{"type":"text","text":"睦就这么认真地，独自坐在椅子上，唱着熟悉的歌。","id":342},{"type":"dialog","id":343},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":344},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":345},{"type":"sticker","id":346,"multi":"true","text":"“透过层层云彩，不断闪闪发光”","x":"300","y":"200","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":347,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n“填满心灵又满溢而出”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":348,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n“脸颊不知不觉，亦在闪闪发光”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":349,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n“热泪沾湿了我的面庞”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":350,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n“你的手为何如此温暖”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":351,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n“求求你，从此再也不要放开——”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":352},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":353},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":354},{"type":"text","text":"如果不松开手的话——","id":355},{"type":"text","text":"睦在这里找到的幸福就——","id":356},{"type":"dialog","id":357},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstprun","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"nrun","id":358},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"nrun","fadetime":"4","id":359},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_65_i07_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2.5","block":"true","id":360},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":361},{"type":"text","text":"祥子转过身，仓皇而逃。","id":362},{"type":"text","text":"就这样，消失在夜色中。","id":363},{"type":"dialog","id":364},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":365},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":366},{"type":"charslot","id":367},{"type":"image","id":368}],"characters":["若叶睦","丰川祥子","？？？","睦的母亲","温米","众人"]}